Name Easter Note - Reception #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 Reception Log: 8/5/17
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ------
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Stranger: Hello?
Interactability_Text_Line_3 Reception: Hello, you’ve reached the Vermillin Help Desk. My name is Karen, what do you need today? Keep in mind this conversation is recorded.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Stranger: Oh, my name is Clark, I’m a writer for the Rapa Nui Post, I’d like to schedule an interview with a representative from your company.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 Reception: I see, normally we wouldn’t take you up on your offer, but since we’ve been doing such major work on this Island I think it should be find, I’ll pass your request on to management.